            <div class="content-text">
                
                <p><strong>Multi-Specialty Hospitals (Saket, Dwarka):</strong> Apollo, Fortis, Max, BLK. Most complex: exempt clinical + taxable room rent + pharmacy + cafeteria + parking. ITC apportionment under S.17(2) monthly.</p><p><strong>Standalone Clinics (Rohini, Dwarka, GK):</strong> Mostly exempt services. May not need GST if <Rs 20L. Doctors >Rs 50L need books (S.44AA). Tax audit if opting out of S.44ADA.</p><p><strong>Diagnostic Centres (Dr Lal, SRL):</strong> Within hospital admission: exempt. Standalone: 18% GST. Careful classification critical.</p><p><strong>Pharmacies (Karol Bagh, retail):</strong> GST at 5% (life-saving), 12% (formulations), 18% (others). HSN code classification. Batch/expiry tracking.</p><p><strong>Nursing Homes + Health-Tech Startups:</strong> Clinical exempt, but tech platform fees/subscriptions may attract 18% GST.</p>

